{"id":"jurado","lemma":"jurado","pos":"noun","rank":1128,"glosses":["juror, juryman, juryperson (member of a jury [sense 1])","judge (member of a jury [sense 2]; officiator of a competitive event)"],"ipa":"/xuˈɾado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"jurados","feminine":"jurada","femininePlural":"juradas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/70/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-jurado.wav","examples":[{"text":"El jurado deliberó durante tres días.","en":"The jurors deliberated for three days.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"day","l":"día"}]},{"text":"¿Podrías describirle al jurado qué ocurrió?","en":"Could you describe to the jury what happened?","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},null,{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"}]},{"text":"El jurado está en desacuerdo.","en":"The jury is hung.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443424","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"disagreement"}]},{"text":"El jurado lo absolvió del delito.","en":"The jury acquitted him of the crime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703626","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"crime"}]},{"text":"¿El jurado ha alcanzado un veredicto?","en":"Has the jury reached a verdict?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567867","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"in debt"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"verdict"}]}]}